    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50fd996501a88cb39794f0f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明明您难得为我提议去海外远征的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20306bcaccafede2aeced38d4a215d428fa51a00216cf6f3c05ba99a1ac428d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f43d5043d9f201d3eebdd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总之，先在『日本杯』上加油吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8f41d3d4f9b12f5849fa64da78db9e632c45ffc03b9b4211b62fcf4d79b845",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e648238ae13e9283650a3fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，我连忙摇头。\n虽然有感到违和感的瞬间……\n但她同样也在为了恢复而不断努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edf585eb5d1a66eed527ada4ac55d4a53b066f2410873752dcc54b037f2d8b73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b57d67c4d77ee4d37f50186",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定是――我的错觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91e829be379460f79a559464945066ec150fe03d80ddf432319fdb86af0596e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c93907dd673370b2fc0152",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹怀抱的编织希望这一坚定的决心\n不可能会完全消失的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "300361d9d3fac9eaf00e87feb7086c9781a9561649af78ef4f130889d9a7b3bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec2cb70bb258f74daca6a8c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "何况她平日里的样子也并无改变。\n对谁都温柔体贴，\n依旧不会放过任何一个孤独的人不管。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86e418e0ce4b3385141fd4cc369697b7b15805e176664633690ad4d3d5d97798",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f0fdff4d9fbc35a3770781a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
