    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f75a0f227ad704a0f23c492",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那里，\n如果能再次……跑出编织希望的比赛的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c7b196dcb8bf19f882545936ae1e9469d7520ac3697dc870472cd610c96ddf5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
