      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a2d3bc9549a7281903781c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那带着困惑、飘忽不定的语尾\n我没能听到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "915aafe82910eb8168a23d95e2a175f882a1ec8120144ce9e4bf39d657c2ed00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2166283036dd235f7ea5a86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "向前迈进吧。\n那样的话，一切一定会好起来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c48b1a27588db074e3093d3a145de2a4cec3b144c3c967e71b3890caa18d716",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57405fee53c37bb922147e49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……海外远征的事，就取消吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd5bc123450952337e3ec357af120d114f031a8d4527542496889084cc49168",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad59f501d5b85baa498100d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训的最后一天。\n我向她提出了一个建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fec0e58c14aa21833a22aaab1c86b7b4a061fe6ff7c9971ff1fe7040b901413",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
