    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4fab8b9bd5080532c93a5c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是……。果然因为，\n我的状态没有恢复吗。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "218b07c73e1753dd7a4e18647916026c6576f528f1e7fd4ace632cf6e354f009",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd740b6957033623666992a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把手中的平板电脑递给她看。\n上面排列着毫无变化的数字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b35e1ed10b3c8e188b326ee45edfd7f093dbd2a8e65d7cc539f6a954ff96067f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f60e88eed0173e34fdddeb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……而且）",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e4be639cbab40a1a9c90629eb52847e9b21dd8b4f683b79a5550a34e4767836",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0379225b8fe2b07f57b13ab9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正如她所说，\n直到最后她也没能回到“原本的状态”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e1d4f107476ffc7f46b5aee9c9e8932d64614306e722e1be623ef8541e98569",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5318db1a4ac11a18686f933",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在肉体上的状况不佳并不可见的同时――",
      "source_fingerprint": "854ce65fff899c7fee6cb245aefa709de7b9f1843bc65e92b1bccc57776c949a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
